# Lane PR-body drafts. `.epic520/_docs/LANE_RUNBOOK.md` §4b tells lanes to write
# these into their own worktree rather than the shared scratchpad, so two
# concurrent lanes cannot clobber each other's. The worktree IS the repo, so
# without this they get swept in by `git add -A` and shipped.
.pr-*.md
